{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>從900萬輛到1000萬輛，特斯拉僅用時約7個月。目前，上海超級工廠已貢獻特斯拉全球近一半的電動車產量。從2006年首輛Roadster原型車下線，到如今駛向全球的1000萬輛，特斯拉的產量軌跡也折射出電動汽車行業的快速增長。</p>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://d.ifengimg.com/w820_h1777_ablur_q90_webp/x0.ifengimg.com/res/2026/86BB903D880C9FCF741607EDAC2CDB3E5F34F5A1_size587_w820_h1777.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-30T07:59:44.021103+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":1,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none"}}